warning[large-union-variant]: union variant `large_array` is 1024 bytes, which is significantly larger than the average of other variants (1 bytes)
   ┌ test.idl:5:18
   │
 2 │ union MyUnion switch (short) {
 3 │     case 1: char small_data;
   ·                  ^^^^^^^^^^ 1 bytes
 4 │     case 2: short another_small;
   ·                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 2 bytes
 5 │     case 3: char large_array[1024];  // This is 1KB, much larger than others
   ·                  ^^^^^^^^^^^ large variant (1024 bytes)
 6 │ };
   └──
 note: consider annotating large variants with `@shared` to heap allocate them
